      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 7,
      "values:originalText": "Insert:\n\n(1A) Part IIB binds the Crown in right of the States.\n\n[Minister’s second reading speech made in—\nHouse of Representatives on 21 February 2002\nSenate on 13 March 2002]\n\n(34/02)"
